@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to create a scenario for a map
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows all existing maps and asks for the scenario conditions
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a map and types requested scenario data, including the port's cargo and \n behaviour, the available locomotion types and the industry generation changers

    activate System

        System --> Employee : receives and shows all data and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms data for scenario creation
    activate System

        System --> Employee : creates the scenario and displays success
    deactivate System
@enduml